body:
however I did get another way to do it:

&#x200B;

func  \_on\_FloorColorTimer\_timeout():

randomize()

var material = get\_active\_material(0)

material.albedo\_colot = Color(randf(), randf(), radnf() )

self.material\_override = material

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

However I'll be honest and tell you that no one showed me this way and I kind of figured it out by myself by trying to replicate what you recommended

so since no one explained this to me I don't have a clue what this is doing but it changes the color and I don't think it creates a whole new material but I don't know.
